        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have portfolio mortgage products that we developed for use by ACM to help diversify our total loan portfolio.",
        "start_character": 15816,
        "end_character": 15941
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001675644-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001675644-26-000017-f412507a9985bce9",
        "accession_number": "0001675644-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Several of our competitors have substantially greater resources and lending limits than we have, and offer certain services, such as extensive and established branch networks and trust services that we do not currently provide or currently expect to provide in the near future.",
        "start_character": 27606,
        "end_character": 27883
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001675644-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001675644-26-000017-f412507a9985bce9",
        "accession_number": "0001675644-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through correspondents, referrals to third parties with whom we have partnered, and our own capabilities, we are a full service financial provider, able to compete in substantially all areas of banking, except trust services.",
        "start_character": 26589,
        "end_character": 26814
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001675644-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001675644-26-000017-f412507a9985bce9",
        "accession_number": "0001675644-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer digital banking, mobile banking and a remote deposit service, which allows clients to facilitate and expedite deposit transactions through the use of electronic devices.",
        "start_character": 8431,
        "end_character": 8614
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001675644-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001675644-26-000017-f412507a9985bce9",
        "accession_number": "0001675644-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide secure credit card processing and merchant services, with reporting tailored to customer needs.",
        "start_character": 23074,
        "end_character": 23185
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001675644-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001675644-26-000017-f412507a9985bce9",
        "accession_number": "0001675644-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe these larger competitors generally cannot provide the same level of attention and customization of services to small businesses that we seek to provide.",
        "start_character": 26425,
        "end_character": 26588
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001675644-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001675644-26-000017-f412507a9985bce9",
        "accession_number": "0001675644-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have partnered with experienced service providers in both insurance and merchant services to further augment the products available to our customers.",
        "start_character": 8740,
        "end_character": 8892
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001675644-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001675644-26-000017-f412507a9985bce9",
        "accession_number": "0001675644-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manage and control credit risk in our loan portfolio by adhering to well-defined underwriting criteria and account administration standards established by management, and approved by the board of directors.",
        "start_character": 30004,
        "end_character": 30213
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001675644-26-000017",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001675644-26-000017-f412507a9985bce9",
        "accession_number": "0001675644-26-000017",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manage our investment portfolio according to written investment policies approved by our board of directors.",
        "start_character": 33318,
        "end_character": 33429
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001675644-26-000017",
